sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Host or Member
    participant App as Expo mobile app
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant Auth as Firebase Auth
    participant Fn as Cloud Functions
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant QR as VietQR or banking app

    rect rgb(238, 244, 255)
        Note over User,FS: Auth flow
        User->>App: Register or login with email and password
        App->>Auth: Authenticate
        Auth-->>App: Native persisted auth state
        App->>Fn: completeRegistrationProfile with ID token
        Fn->>FS: Create or validate users uid
        FS-->>Fn: Profile result
        Fn-->>App: Authenticated profile
    end

    rect rgb(239, 250, 244)
        Note over User,FS: Solo Focus flow with offline-first capture
        User->>App: Start Solo Focus Mode
        App->>DB: Insert ACTIVE session
        loop Phone-Down Detection
            App->>App: Evaluate orientation and 3-Second Grace Period
            alt Confirmed violation
                App->>DB: Transaction insert Violation Log and sync_outbox
                DB-->>App: Durable local commit
            end
        end
        User->>App: Complete session
        App->>DB: Transaction complete session and queue summary
        opt Network is reachable
            App->>Fn: syncEvents batch
            Fn->>FS: Transaction write events and receipts
            FS-->>Fn: Per-event outcomes
            Fn-->>App: Acknowledgments
            App->>DB: Mark events SYNCED
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 235)
        Note over User,FS: Group Room create, join, active and completion
        User->>App: Create or join room
        App->>Fn: createRoom or joinRoomByPin
        Fn->>FS: Transaction validate quota, PIN, capacity and membership
        FS-->>Fn: Room and membership
        Fn-->>App: WAITING room
        App->>FS: Listen to room and members
        User->>App: Host starts session
        App->>Fn: startRoom
        Fn->>FS: WAITING to ACTIVE transaction
        FS-->>App: ACTIVE snapshot
        loop Active session
            App->>DB: Capture local violations atomically
            App->>Fn: syncEvents when reachable
            Fn->>FS: Idempotent violation and aggregate transaction
            FS-->>App: Realtime Penalty Leaderboard
        end
        User->>App: Host completes room
        App->>Fn: completeRoom
        Fn->>FS: ACTIVE to COMPLETED and reconciliation PENDING
        FS-->>App: Completion snapshot
        App->>Fn: Flush events then acknowledgeMemberSync
        Fn->>FS: Record Member sync acknowledgment
        alt Every Member acknowledged
            Fn->>FS: Finalize scores with ALL_SYNCED
        else Host accepts missing Member warning
            User->>App: Confirm finalization override
            App->>Fn: finalizeRoomScores
            Fn->>FS: Finalize scores with HOST_OVERRIDE
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over App,FS: Unexpected network loss and recovery
        FS--xApp: Connection lost during active use
        loop While offline
            App->>DB: Transaction persist domain event and PENDING outbox item
            DB-->>App: Continue under approved offline policy
        end
        App->>App: Connectivity becomes reachable
        App->>DB: Lease bounded PENDING batch as IN_FLIGHT
        App->>Fn: syncEvents with event IDs and versioned payloads
        loop Each event
            Fn->>FS: Check receipt, ownership and session window
            alt New valid event
                Fn->>FS: Transaction domain effect and receipt
                FS-->>Fn: Success outcome
            else Existing matching receipt
                FS-->>Fn: Previous success outcome
            else Permanent rejection
                FS-->>Fn: Stable rejection code
            end
        end
        Fn-->>App: Per-event acknowledgment
        App->>DB: SYNCED, PENDING retry, or REJECTED
    end

    rect rgb(245, 240, 255)
        Note over User,QR: Bill Settlement and VietQR P2P
        User->>App: Host enters total bill and optional overrides
        App->>Fn: calculateBillShares or applyBillOverrides
        Fn->>FS: Validate finalized scores and integer VND allocation
        FS-->>App: Realtime authoritative bill shares
        User->>App: Member selects Pay Share
        App->>QR: Generate VietQR from authoritative share
        QR-->>User: Open or scan in banking app
        User->>App: Host manually confirms payment
        App->>Fn: markBillSharePaid
        Fn->>FS: UNPAID to MARKED_AS_PAID
    end

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User,FS: Activation flow
        User->>App: Enter activation code
        alt Offline
            App->>App: Validate format and checksum
            App->>DB: Store PENDING_VERIFICATION entitlement
        else Online
            App->>Fn: redeemActivationCode
            Fn->>FS: Transaction redeem hashed code once
            Fn->>FS: Set users uid isPremium true
            Fn-->>App: Verified entitlement
            App->>DB: Store verified premium state
        end
    end
